= Tamil Militant Groups

{!<img src="img/tamil_militants.jpg" style="width: 85%; height: auto; border: 4px solid rgb(43, 43, 43); padding: 4px; background-color: var(--content-bg-color); box-shadow: inset 2px 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); display: block; margin: 0 auto;">!}

<div style="position: relative; width: 100%; display: block; margin-top: 45px; padding-bottom: 0;">
